      "id": "PR_kwDOL-xLQ87OxU4E",
      "title": "refactor(proxyd): extract updateELBackend from UpdateBackend",
      "author": "jelias2",
      "number": 595,
      "body": "\r\n\r\n<!-- Contributions welcome! See https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md -->\r\n\r\n**Description**\r\nExtract the three EL block fetches and their zero-value validation into a dedicated updateELBackend() function, symmetric to the upcoming updateCLBackend(). Adds sentinel errors for zero-block responses so callers don't need to inspect log messages to distinguish failure modes.\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\n\r\nPlease describe any tests you've added. If you've added no tests, or left important behavior untested, please explain why not.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nAdd any other context about the problem you're solving.\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\n\r\n- Fixes #[Link to Issue]\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/infra",
